1
00:00:00,635 --> 00:00:05,465
General Legal has sponsored MikeOSS to
design MikeGC: a fork of Mike,

2
00:00:05,515 --> 00:00:07,200
built for in-house legal teams.

3
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:09,130
Its first feature is Intake.

4
00:00:12,075 --> 00:00:17,500
Email, Slack or Teams: wherever requests
arrive, Intake brings them into one queue.

5
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:23,975
Mention @MikeGC or email your intake
address. MikeGC records the subject,

6
00:00:24,025 --> 00:00:26,900
the requester, the deadline and the
documents.

7
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:30,505
Your rules send it to the right lawyer,

8
00:00:30,555 --> 00:00:35,220
and MikeGC runs a first pass against your
playbook before anyone opens it.

9
00:00:38,045 --> 00:00:39,895
Ask follow-up questions,

10
00:00:39,945 --> 00:00:44,165
then send the answer and the redline back
to the thread the request came from.

11
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:51,860
And see what's open, what's overdue and
who's carrying the load.
